{
 "_what": "Every piece of the four video components as the code runs them on 2026-11-17, in order, with what each piece reads and writes, what holds it, the skill that switches it on and the sub-processes it calls; then each seam between components (what the one hands over, what the next one's door reads) and the gaps where they do not meet. Read from code (file:line) by four readers on 2026-11-17. The base for defining and refining the workflows. Kinds: stage (a model call with a prompt) · gate (a check that can hold) · repair (a patch or retry loop) · sub-process (a call into another component or tool) · owner-stop (waits for a person) · filing · pack · station.",
